    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious room, greeted by a bloodied mask that warns you: escape before 12 o'clock, or face a terrifying fate. To break free, you'll need to solve a series of challenging puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mask\u2019s games are based on different types of questions, including logic, astronomy, and mathematics. Successfully completing these tasks will reveal parts of a secret code you need to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is of the essence! If you fail, the clock speeds up, making each second count. Your time to escape is recorded, and you can compete for the fastest completion time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Pico, SteamVR, and Oculus Quest.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious room, greeted by a bloodied mask that warns you: escape before 12 o'clock, or face a terrifying fate. To break free, you'll need to solve a series of challenging puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mask\u2019s games are based on different types of questions, including logic, astronomy, and mathematics. Successfully completing these tasks will reveal parts of a secret code you need to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is of the essence! If you fail, the clock speeds up, making each second count. Your time to escape is recorded, and you can compete for the fastest completion time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Pico, SteamVR, and Oculus Quest.</p></li></ul>",
